<https://members-api.parliament.uk/api/Members/5053> <http://schema.org/sameAs> <https://www.linkedin.com/shareArticle?mini=true&#038;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F104031649007599_988473707222462&#038;title=%09It%20was%20a%20pleasure%20to%20visit%20Cygnet%20Manor%20Cygnet%20Group%20in%20Shirebrook%20%E2%80%93%20a%20high%20dependency%20complex%20care%20service%20for%20men%20with%20learning%20disabilities%20and%20associated%20complex%20needs.%20%20%20%20They%20get%20patients%20from%20all%20over%20England%20as%20admission%20is%20based%20on%20need%2C%20not%20location.%20%20Their%20treatment%20pathways%20can%20include%20support%20from%20psychology%2C%20speech%20and%20language%2C%20occupational%20therapy%20and%20more.%20%20As%20with%20so%20much%20in%20healthcare%2C%20funding%20is%20the%20biggest%20barrier%2C%20but%20they%20are%20working%20hard%20to%20give%20their%20residents%20the%20best%20experience%20possible.%20%20%20%20The%20staff%20clearly%20care%20about%20their%20patients%20and%20showed%20real%20pride%20when%20talking%20about%20those%20who%20successfully%20moved%20on%20to%20live%20in%20the%20community.%20%09%09> <https://forgetmenot.local/graph/identity/scraped> .
