<https://members-api.parliament.uk/api/Members/5134> <http://schema.org/sameAs> <https://www.linkedin.com/shareArticle?mini=true&#038;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F123344764529899_1108892194394878&#038;title=%09Today%2C%20the%20Government%20have%20announced%20a%20commitment%20to%20establish%20a%20new%20National%20Housing%20Bank%2C%20which%20will%20be%20the%20government%E2%80%99s%20investment%20arm%20for%20housing%2C%20backed%20by%20%C2%A316bn%20of%20finance.This%20finance%2C%20over%20its%20lifetime%2C%20will%20support%20delivery%20of%20over%20500%2C000%20new%20homes%2C%20hundreds%20of%20thousands%20of%20job%20opportunities%20in%20the%20construction%20sector%2C%20and%20generate%20an%20additional%20%C2%A353bn%20of%20additional%20private%20investment.%C2%A32.5%20billion%20of%20low-interest%20loans%20will%20be%20available%20for%20social%20housing%20providers%20to%20increase%20their%20capacity%20to%20invest%20in%20new%20developments.%20As%20part%20of%20this%20announcement%2C%20an%20additional%20%C2%A35bn%20of%20capital%20grant%20funding%20will%20be%20available%20for%20housing%2C%20deployed%20across%20the%20country%20by%20Homes%20England%20and%20Mayors%20to%20support%20housing%20delivery.%20Alongside%20the%20work%20of%20the%20Bank%2C%20this%20will%20deliver%20grant%20funding%20to%20projects%20which%20would%20otherwise%20be%20unviable.%20It%20will%20bring%20forward%20large%2C%20complex%20and%20transformative%20schemes%2C%20including%20those%20which%20require%20remediation%20of%20brownfield%20sites.This%20is%20the%20kind%20of%20long%20term%2C%20joined%20up%20thinking%20I%26%23039%3Bm%20very%20pleased%20to%20see%20our%20Labour%20Government%20engaging%20in%20to%20tackle%20the%20housing%20crisis.%20%09%09> <https://forgetmenot.local/graph/identity/scraped> .
