<https://members-api.parliament.uk/api/Members/5134> <http://schema.org/sameAs> <https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F123344764529899_1108833254400772> <https://forgetmenot.local/graph/identity/scraped> .
<https://members-api.parliament.uk/api/Members/5134> <http://schema.org/sameAs> <https://www.linkedin.com/shareArticle?mini=true&#038;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F123344764529899_1108833254400772&#038;title=%09Caitlin%20Chippendale%20would%20make%20an%20excellent%20Borough%20Councillor%20for%20Whitworth.%20Her%20strong%20local%20connections%20means%20she%20has%20a%20deep%20understanding%20of%20the%20issues%20affecting%20Whitworth%2C%20and%20it%26%23039%3Bs%20clear%20that%20she%20has%20passion%20and%20experience%20in%20the%20realms%20of%20helping%20people%20and%20solving%20problems.Residents%20of%20Whitworth%20have%20an%20opportunity%20on%20Thursday%2026th%20of%20June%20to%20elect%20someone%20who%20will%20serve%20their%20community%20tirelessly%2C%20and%20that%20candidate%20is%20Labour%26%23039%3Bs%20Caitlin%20Chippendale.Hi%2C%20I%27m%20Caitlin%20Chippendale%20and%20I%27m%20your%20Labour%F0%9F%8C%B9candidate%20for%20Whitworth.%20I%27m%20Rossendale%20born%20and%20bred%20and%20went%20to%20Whitworth%20High%20School%2C%20where%20I%20was%20Head%20Girl.I%27ve%20been%20involved%20in%20local%20politics%20for%20most%20of%20my%20life%20because%20of%20my%20Grandad%20Tom%20Aldred%2C%20a%20very%20well%20known%20and%20respected%20Whitworth%20Town%20Councillor%2C%20Rossendale%20Councillor%20and%20Alderman.%20I%20know%20the%20difference%20that%20an%20active%20and%20involved%20local%20councillor%20can%20make%20to%20the%20lives%20of%20people%20here.%20I%20remember%20going%20out%20leafletting%20and%20campaigning%20with%20my%20grandad%20when%20I%20was%20very%20young%20and%20I%20saw%20for%20myself%20the%20hard%20work%20and%20commitment%20he%20put%20into%20serving%20his%20community%20and%20he%20inspires%20me%20to%20do%20the%20same.I%27m%20a%20problem%20solver.%20I%20work%20for%20a%20charity%20which%20rehouses%20homeless%20people%20and%20I%27m%20with%20them%20every%20step%20of%20the%20way%20in%20helping%20to%20sort%20out%20their%20problems.%20I%20ensure%20that%20people%20get%20a%20helping%20hand%20when%20they%20need%20it.I%27m%20studying%20for%20a%20maths%20degree%20at%20the%20Open%20University%20and%20I%27d%20like%20to%20become%20a%20Maths%20teacher.%20I%27ve%20been%20working%20towards%20this%20by%20providing%20voluntary%20tuition%20for%20local%20schoolchildren.I%27m%20an%20active%20member%20of%20the%20Mayor%20of%20Rossendale%27s%20fundraising%20committee%20and%20I%27ve%20enjoyed%20arranging%20events%20to%20raise%20money%20for%20the%20Mayor%27s%20chosen%20charities.Amongst%20my%20local%20concerns%20are%20the%20poor%20state%20of%20the%20roads%20and%20pavements%20in%20our%20area%2C%20particularly%20along%20Market%20St%2C%20and%20the%20unsatisfactory%20standard%20of%20repair%20work%20from%20Lancashire%20County%20Council.%20I%27m%20also%20worried%20about%20loneliness%20and%20depression%20in%20the%20community%20and%20accessibility%20to%20Mental%20Health%20Services%2C%20particularly%20for%20young%20people.As%20your%20local%20Whitworth%20Councillor%20I%20will%20be%20a%20strong%20voice%20for%20our%20area.%20I%20would%20be%20honoured%20to%20be%20given%20the%20chance%20to%20represent%20Whitworth%20at%20Rossendale%20Borough%20Council%20and%20I%20hope%20that%20voters%20will%20put%20their%20faith%20in%20me%20at%20the%20polling%20station%20on%20June%2026th.%20%20%09%09> <https://forgetmenot.local/graph/identity/scraped> .
<https://members-api.parliament.uk/api/Members/5134> <http://schema.org/sameAs> <https://www.facebook.com/123344764529899_1108691797748251> <https://forgetmenot.local/graph/identity/scraped> .
<https://members-api.parliament.uk/api/Members/5134> <http://schema.org/sameAs> <https://www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F123344764529899_1108691797748251> <https://forgetmenot.local/graph/identity/scraped> .
<https://members-api.parliament.uk/api/Members/5134> <http://schema.org/sameAs> <https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F123344764529899_1108691797748251> <https://forgetmenot.local/graph/identity/scraped> .
<https://members-api.parliament.uk/api/Members/5134> <http://schema.org/sameAs> <https://www.linkedin.com/shareArticle?mini=true&#038;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F123344764529899_1108691797748251&#038;title=%09Today%20is%20Thank%20a%20Teacher%20Day.%20It%26%23039%3Bs%20an%20opportunity%20for%20all%20of%20us%20to%20say%20thank%20you%20to%20the%20many%20teachers%20working%20hard%20for%20young%20people%20across%20Rossendale%20and%20Darwen.%20This%20Labour%20government%20is%20backing%20our%20teachers%20because%20we%20know%20that%20high%20quality%20teaching%20is%20the%20single%20biggest%20way%20to%20improve%20outcomes%20for%20young%20people.%20We%20are%20delivering%3A-%20A%205.5%25%20pay%20rise%20last%20year%2C%204%25%20this%20year-%20Action%20on%20workload%20and%20wellbeing-%20Record%20investment%20in%20our%20schools%20at%20the%20Spending%20Review-%20Ensuring%20teachers%20aren%E2%80%99t%20overstretched%20and%20undervalued%20as%20they%20were%20under%20the%20ToriesAs%20part%20of%20our%20Plan%20for%20Change%2C%20we%20are%20already%20seeing%20the%20results%20of%20this%20strategy%3A-%20We%E2%80%99ve%20ended%20year-on%20year%20declines%20in%20teacher%20recruitment-%20A%2024%25%20increase%20in%20vital%20STEM%20subjects%20%E2%80%93%20up%2049%25%20in%20computing%2C%2044%25%20in%20physics-%20Over%202%2C300%20more%20teachers%20in%20our%20secondaries%20and%20special%20schools-%20Over%20a%20thousand%20more%20in%20training-%20We%E2%80%99re%20over%20a%20third%20of%20the%20way%20to%20our%20first%20step%20of%20recruiting%206%2C500%20expert%20teachersIf%20you%20are%20interested%20in%20shaping%20lives%20and%20breaking%20down%20barriers%20of%20opportunity%20for%20young%20people%20in%20Rossendale%20and%20Darwen%2C%20check%20out%20getintoteaching.education.gov.uk%2FDid%20you%20have%20a%20favourite%20teacher%20when%20you%20were%20a%20student%3F%20Perhaps%20someone%20who%20inspired%20you%20and%20changed%20the%20course%20of%20your%20life%3F%20Share%20your%20memories%20and%20messages%20of%20appreciation%20for%20the%20teachers%20of%20Rossendale%20and%20Darwen%20in%20the%20comments%20below.%20%09%09> <https://forgetmenot.local/graph/identity/scraped> .
