<https://members-api.parliament.uk/api/Members/5134> <http://schema.org/sameAs> <https://www.linkedin.com/shareArticle?mini=true&#038;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F1107512824532815&#038;title=%09Here%20in%20Rossendale%20and%20Darwen%2C%20Valley%20Leadership%20Academy%20is%20a%20vital%20school%20serving%20some%20of%20our%20most%20disadvantaged%20communities.%20It%20was%20recently%20identified%20as%20a%20%26%23039%3Bstuck%26%23039%3B%20school%20following%20successive%20%26%23039%3Brequires%20improvement%26%23039%3B%20Ofsted%20assessments.%20I%20know%20the%20staff%20and%20leadership%20at%20the%20school%20are%20working%20incredibly%20hard%20to%20drive%20improvement%2C%20and%20we%20are%20starting%20to%20see%20positive%20signs.I%20spoke%20in%20the%20House%20of%20Commons%20today%20to%20ask%20the%20Minister%20of%20State%20for%20School%20Standards%2C%20Catherine%20McKinnell%2C%20to%20update%20me%20on%20what%20we%20are%20doing%20to%20support%20them.She%20said%20%26quot%3BThis%20government%20is%20delivering%20a%20new%20era%20of%20high%20and%20rising%20school%20standards%20because%20we%20know%20that%20when%20standards%20slip%2C%20it%20is%20disadvantaged%20children%20that%20suffer%20and%20we%20won%26%23039%3Bt%20let%20that%20happen.%20That%26%23039%3Bs%20why%20Labour%26%23039%3Bs%20RISE%20teams%20are%20spearheading%20a%20stronger%2C%20faster%20system%20prioritising%20stuck%20schools%2C%20sending%20in%20advisors%20with%20a%20proven%20track%20record%20of%20turning%20schools%20around%2C%20and%20backing%20it%20up%20with%20up%20to%20%C2%A320%20million%20pounds.%26quot%3B%20%09%09> <https://forgetmenot.local/graph/identity/scraped> .
