<https://members-api.parliament.uk/api/Members/5134> <http://schema.org/sameAs> <https://www.linkedin.com/shareArticle?mini=true&#038;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F123344764529899_1107344214549676&#038;title=%09Residents%20of%20Tonacliffe%20Road%20are%20very%20concerned%20about%20inconsiderate%20parking%20at%20school%20times%2C%20speeding%20vehicles%20and%20gridlock.As%20we%20are%20all%20aware%2C%20highways%20are%20the%20responsibility%20of%20Lancashire%20County%20Council.%20If%20elected%20as%20your%20Rossendale%20Borough%20Councillor%2C%20I%20will%20work%20with%20Lancashire%20Highways%20to%20find%20a%20solution.I%20believe%20in%20co-operation%20rather%20than%20conflict%20and%20I%20will%20work%20with%20all%20groups%20to%20get%20the%20best%20for%20Whitworth.%20The%20Community%20First%20Councillors%20put%20forward%20an%20excellent%20plan%20last%20year%20to%20make%20sections%20of%20Tonacliffe%20Road%20one%20way%20to%20help%20calm%20traffic%20and%20prevent%20%E2%80%9Crat%20running%E2%80%9D.%20As%20your%20ward%20councillor%2C%20I%20will%20work%20with%20my%20fellow%20councillors%20and%20the%20County%20Council%2C%20using%20this%20plan%20as%20a%20basis%2C%20to%20get%20a%20solution%20that%20works%20for%20everyone.%23whitworthbyelection%23VoteLocal%20%23VoteCaitlin%20%23VoteLabour%F0%9F%8C%B9%20%20%09%09> <https://forgetmenot.local/graph/identity/scraped> .
