<https://members-api.parliament.uk/api/Members/5173> <http://schema.org/sameAs> <https://www.linkedin.com/shareArticle?mini=true&#038;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F216275051562301_122267652464164005&#038;title=%09A%20real%20privilege%20to%20celebrate%20Buddha%20Jayanti%20today%20at%20the%20Empire%20in%20Aldershot%2C%20with%20the%20Buddhist%20Centre%20Community%20UK%20%28BCCUK%29.%20The%20BCCUK%20is%20a%20living%2C%20breathing%20community%20at%20the%20heart%20of%20Aldershot%20and%20home%20to%20the%20largest%20Buddhist%20community%20in%20the%20UK.%20It%20was%20also%20great%20to%20hear%20their%20plans%20to%20further%20invest%20in%20and%20elevate%20the%20centre.%20Organisations%20like%20this%20really%20shape%20our%20wonderful%20towns.%20It%20was%20to%20come%20together%20and%20reflect%20on%20what%20Dharma%20means%2C%20removing%20negativity%20between%20us%2C%20a%20value%20at%20the%20centre%20of%20today%E2%80%99s%20celebrations.At%20a%20time%20when%20the%20world%20can%20feel%20divided%2C%20we%20need%20more%20Dharma%20in%20the%20world.%20In%20Aldershot%2C%20we%20stand%20for%20a%20community%20where%20everyone%20belongs%20and%20feels%20proud%20to%20call%20this%20place%20home.Dhanyabad%20and%20a%20very%20happy%20Buddha%20Jayanti%20to%20all%20celebrating.%23aldershot%20%23farnborough%20%23blackwater%20%23hawley%20%23yateley%20%09%09> <https://forgetmenot.local/graph/identity/scraped> .
