<https://members-api.parliament.uk/api/Members/5173> <http://schema.org/sameAs> <https://www.linkedin.com/shareArticle?mini=true&#038;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F216275051562301_122267533544164005&#038;title=%09In%20the%20debate%20regarding%20the%20carry-over%20of%20the%20Northern%20Ireland%20Troubles%20Bill%2C%20I%20was%20clear%20that%20veterans%20in%20my%20community%20needed%20further%20reassurances%20and%20that%20I%20was%20reserving%20judgement.%20Working%20with%20Bayo%20Alaba%20MP%2C%20I%20was%20pleased%20to%20facilitate%20discussion%20on%20the%20Bill%20between%20members%20of%20the%20Parachute%20Regimental%20Association%20and%20Government%20officials%20in%2010%20Downing%20Street%20yesterday.%20%20It%20is%20vital%20that%20our%20veterans%20have%20clear%2C%20strong%20protections%20from%20malicious%20lawfare%2C%20and%20that%20their%20voices%20are%20heard%20as%20this%20legislation%20is%20shaped.%20This%20was%20a%20constructive%20meeting%2C%20and%20both%20sides%20committed%20to%20continue%20talks%20as%20amendments%20are%20brought%20forward.%20The%20sacrifices%20made%20by%20our%20Armed%20Forces%20in%20Northern%20Ireland%20and%20beyond%20must%20never%20be%20forgotten.%20We%20must%20get%20this%20right%2C%20for%20our%20veterans%2C%20for%20victims%2C%20and%20to%20finally%20deliver%20the%20closure%20and%20justice%20so%20many%20have%20waited%20for.%20%09%09> <https://forgetmenot.local/graph/identity/scraped> .
