<https://members-api.parliament.uk/api/Members/5173> <http://schema.org/sameAs> <https://www.linkedin.com/shareArticle?mini=true&#038;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F216275051562301_122266672064164005&#038;title=%09Happy%20St%20George%E2%80%99s%20Day%20to%20everyone%20across%20Aldershot%20and%20Farnborough%F0%9F%8F%B4%F3%A0%81%A7%F3%A0%81%A2%F3%A0%81%A5%F3%A0%81%AE%F3%A0%81%A7%F3%A0%81%BFWatching%20the%20flag-raising%20in%20Aldershot%20this%20morning%2C%20and%20being%20surrounded%20by%20our%20community%2C%20I%20couldn%26%23039%3Bt%20help%20but%20reflect%20on%20what%20makes%20me%20proud%20to%20be%20English%20and%20the%20values%20that%20define%20us.%20At%20the%20heart%20of%20St%20George%26%23039%3Bs%20story%20is%20courage%20and%20hope%20%2C%20the%20belief%20that%20goodness%20can%20overcome%20evil%2C%20and%20that%20strength%20is%20at%20its%20best%20when%20guided%20by%20kindness.%20When%20I%E2%80%99m%20out%20in%20our%20towns%20I%20see%20those%20values%20in%20action%20every%20day.%20In%20those%20who%20serve%2C%20and%20the%20families%20and%20friends%20in%20our%20community%20who%20stand%20behind%20them%2C%20supporting%20one%20another.%20Wishing%20you%20all%20a%20very%20happy%20St%20George%E2%80%99s%20Day%21%23Aldershot%20%23farnborough%20%23blackwater%20%23hawley%20%23yateley%20%09%09> <https://forgetmenot.local/graph/identity/scraped> .
