<https://members-api.parliament.uk/api/Members/5173> <http://schema.org/sameAs> <https://www.linkedin.com/shareArticle?mini=true&#038;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F216275051562301_122266567832164005&#038;title=%09I%20was%20delighted%20to%20host%20my%20friend%20General%20Sir%20Roly%20Walker%20at%20Cody%20Technology%20Park%20last%20week%2C%20and%20to%20introduce%20him%20to%20some%20of%20our%20brilliant%20local%20businesses%2C%20including%20SAAB%2C%20SiXworks%2C%20Sopra%20Steria%2C%20and%20QinetiQ.As%20Chief%20of%20the%20General%20Staff%2C%20he%20is%20focused%20on%20ensuring%20that%20our%20troops%20have%20the%20best%20possible%20equipment%20to%20keep%20this%20country%20safe.%20So%20it%20was%20great%20to%20introduce%20these%20businesses%2C%20which%2C%20as%20well%20as%20employing%20local%20people%2C%20help%20build%20so%20much%20of%20that%20vital%20defence%20capability%20here%20on%20our%20doorstep.I%E2%80%99m%20looking%20forward%20to%20seeing%20this%20cooperation%20develop%2C%20to%20increase%20opportunities%20for%20our%20community%20and%20strengthen%20our%20national%20security.%20%09%09> <https://forgetmenot.local/graph/identity/scraped> .
